	novel_interface.show_character("ai","wink")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("確實如此。 當訊息的密度夠大，熵值夠低，就可能產生自我意識。","愛衣")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	novel_interface.show_character("liliu_research","angry")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("隨著法貝拉陷入沉睡、理智斷線，那種「活的訊息」就會開始慢慢侵蝕她的身體……","莉琉")
	await novel_interface.hide_character()
	await novel_interface.show_text_only("我想起曾經看到昏迷不醒的主人被自己養的寵物吃掉的報導，頭皮一陣發麻。")
	novel_interface.show_character("ai","stare")
	await novel_interface.show_dialog("我很快就發現了問題──之所以無法喚醒她，是因為她本來就是清醒的。","愛衣")
	novel_interface.change_expression("normal")
